    "message": "Remove repeated work from the tick phases (stage B4)\n\nThe proposal view is made from the update phase's view; parsed configs, model\nselections and in-room routes are kept while their inputs stay the same; the\nevent queue keeps indexes; a ScheduledEvent's checks and a view's audit hash run\nin Rust. Hashes are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
