    "message": "Keep zone environments, share staff reads, and test what the tick phases keep\n\nRequests of one kind share what is read about the staff; proposals read each\nperson's immediate need from one table; a shared-operation receipt looks only among\nthe newest records. Tests cover each kept input and the paths the gate does not reach.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
